All communication regarding using CVMH basins or UCVM should be directed to 
software@scec.org. Any scientific questions regarding this model should 
be directed to the researchers behind this model.

The data and code for this model is based off of the following paper:

Plesch, A., C.H. Thurber, C. Tape, and J.H. Shaw (2021, 08), The SCEC CVM 
        effort: new basin models, enhanced access and tomographic updates.
        Oral Presentation at 2021 SCEC Annual Meeting
